    {
      "text": "Joseph’s master … put him into the prison, Gen. 39:20. Bring my soul out of prison, Ps. 142:7. prison … after many days shall they be visited, Isa. 24:22. to bring out the prisoners from the prison, Isa. 42:7. He was taken from prison and from judgment, Isa. 53:8 (Mosiah 14:8). opening of the prison to them that are bound, Isa. 61:1 (D&C 138:42). wroth with Jeremiah … put him in prison, Jer. 37:15 (1 Ne. 7:14).",
