    {
      "text": "John was cast into prison, Matt. 4:12 (Mark 1:14). thou be cast into prison, Matt. 5:25 (Luke 12:58; 3 Ne. 12:25). Herod had laid hold on John … put him in prison, Matt. 14:3 (Mark 6:17; Luke 3:20). cast him into prison, till he should pay the debt, Matt. 18:30. I was in prison, and ye came unto me, Matt. 25:36. delivering you up … into prisons, Luke 21:12. ready to go with thee, both into prison, and to death, Luke 22:33. John was not yet cast into prison, John 3:24. apostles, and put them in the common prison, Acts 5:18. Saul … committed them to prison, Acts 8:3 (22:4). Peter therefore was kept in prison, Acts 12:5. foundations of the prison were shaken, Acts 16:26. many of the saints did I shut up in prison, Acts 26:10. in prisons more frequent, 2 Cor. 11:23. preached unto the spirits in prison, 1 Pet. 3:19 (D&C 138:8). devil shall cast some of you into prison, Rev. 2:10. Satan shall be loosed out of his prison, Rev. 20:7.",
